# The vmangos image's build context is this directory, and it copies docker/vmangos/bin/ alone. So
# the context is that folder and nothing else: no Blizzard file (a Data folder or an archive dropped
# in here by mistake), no .env with the database passwords, no build output. The lines after the
# exception keep those out even of docker/vmangos/bin/ itself.
*
!docker/vmangos/bin/
**/*.MPQ
**/*.mpq
# Any case, and a download's partial file (`dbc.MPQ.part`), as in datahost/.dockerignore.
**/*.[Mm][Pp][Qq]*
**/Data/
**/WTF/
.env
**/.env
**/target/
